---
title: 雨夜的告白
theme: 温情
synopsis: |
  雨夜广场，米拉偶遇陈伯。一把伞、几句问候，让两个孤独的灵魂在石板路上靠近。
dsl_version: "1.0"
catalog_version: "1.0.0"
tags: [爱情, 小镇, 雨夜]
cast: [mira, old_chen]
scenes: [plaza]
acts: 1
duration_estimate: 90
tone: 治愈
author: example
language: zh-CN
---

@BEGIN title="雨夜的告白"

@ACT id=1 title="雨夜广场"

@SCENE id=plaza time=evening weather=rain

@CAST actor=mira
@CAST actor=old_chen

@SPAWN_PROP prop=lamp_post id=lamp_1 at=(12, 6) state=on
@SPAWN_PROP prop=lamp_post id=lamp_2 at=(22, 6) state=on
@SPAWN_PROP prop=bench id=bench_1 at=(11, 6) state=empty

@ENTER actor=mira at=(10.8, 6) facing=east
@SIT actor=mira bench=bench_1 seat=0

@ENTER actor=old_chen at=(27, 6) facing=west
@SPAWN_PROP prop=umbrella id=umbrella_1 attach=old_chen offset=(0.4, 0) state=open
@CUT preset=cam_follow target=mira

@NARRATION duration=2.5
雨点敲打着广场的石板路，路灯在水洼里碎成一片金光。

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「今晚的雨，好像永远不会停。」
@END

@MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to=(21, 6) speed=1.2

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「年轻人，伞借你一半。」
@END

@STAND actor=mira

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「谢谢您，陈伯。我这就过来。」
@END

@SET_PROP id=umbrella_1 offset=(-0.4, 0)

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(19.5, 6) speed=1.2
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to=(20.5, 6) speed=1.2
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「有伞真好，雨声也没那么冷了。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「一起走一段吧。」
@END

@FACE actor=mira facing=north
@FACE actor=old_chen facing=north

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(19.5, 10) speed=1.2
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to=(20.5, 10) speed=1.2
@END

@NARRATION duration=2.5
两个人肩并肩走在雨中，广场的灯光忽然变得柔和起来。

@END_SCRIPT
